      "skos:definition": "(3) The amendment of any direction under subsection (1) does not\nprevent the direction, as so amended, from being amended or\nrepealed by the Prime Minister or the Secretary of the Department\n(as the case requires).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00140\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendment of the Australian Civilian Corps Act 2011  Part 1\n\nNo. 140, 2013\nAustralian Civilian Corps Amendment Act 2013",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sec-3-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45e35899a36e819c8d49a67446e2c5e2157d32e836084cb64dfaced199fcf043",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of direction under subsection (1) does not prevent the direction from being amended or repealed by the Prime Minister or the Secretary of the Department."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013#sec-3-ss-3",
