      "values:originalText": "Omit:\n•\nArranged to be displayed in AusAID House, or disposed of in an\nappropriate manner by the Manager, Property and Facilities\nManagement (PFM), having had the matter referred by the HR ADG.\nsubstitute:\n•\nDirect an officer in the Department to dispose of the gift as directed.",
