      "cml:conclusionText": "AusAID etc. refers to oldLegislativeInstrument."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-125",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "125 Directions issued by the Director-General",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-125"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "Directions issued by the Director-General under section 13 or 16 of the\nold Act and in force immediately before the commencement of this Part\ncontinue in effect after that commencement as if they were directions\nissued by the Secretary under section 13 or 16 of the amended Act (as\nthe case requires).\nNote:\nThese directions, as continued in effect, are amended as set out in Part 4.\n126  Effect of things done by, or in relation to, AusAID etc.\nunder the old legislative instruments\n(1)\nA thing done before the commencement of this Part by, or in relation to,\nAusAID, the Director-General or an employee of AusAID under a\nprovision of an old legislative instrument has effect after that\ncommencement, for the purposes of the relevant amended legislative\ninstrument, as if the thing had been done by, or in relation to, the\nDepartment, the Secretary or an employee of the Department (as the\ncase requires) under that provision of the amended legislative\ninstrument.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) does not apply to the making of an instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "Directions issued by the Director-General under section 13 or 16 of the\nold Act and in force immediately before the commencement of this Part\ncontinue in effect after that commencement as if they were directions\nissued by the Secretary under section 13 or 16 of the amended Act (as\nthe case requires).\nNote:\nThese directions, as continued in effect, are amended as set out in Part 4.\n126  Effect of things done by, or in relation to, AusAID etc.\nunder the old legislative instruments\n(1)\nA thing done before the commencement of this Part by, or in relation to,\nAusAID, the Director-General or an employee of AusAID under a\nprovision of an old legislative instrument has effect after that\ncommencement, for the purposes of the relevant amended legislative\ninstrument, as if the thing had been done by, or in relation to, the\nDepartment, the Secretary or an employee of the Department (as the\ncase requires) under that provision of the amended legislative\ninstrument.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) does not apply to the making of an instrument.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-125-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1307a6553fe94c739d54a78aaf116e4c3a6944f904c78f01067df6e728b12c74",
      "skos:note": "Directions issued by the Director-General continue in effect after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-125",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "125 Directions issued by the Director-General",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "Directions issued by the Director-General under section 13 or 16 of the\nold Act and in force immediately before the commencement of this Part\ncontinue in effect after that commencement as if they were directions\nissued by the Secretary under section 13 or 16 of the amended Act (as\nthe case requires).\nNote:\nThese directions, as continued in effect, are amended as set out in Part 4.\n126  Effect of things done by, or in relation to, AusAID etc.\nunder the old legislative instruments\n(1)\nA thing done before the commencement of this Part by, or in relation to,\nAusAID, the Director-General or an employee of AusAID under a\nprovision of an old legislative instrument has effect after that\ncommencement, for the purposes of the relevant amended legislative\ninstrument, as if the thing had been done by, or in relation to, the\nDepartment, the Secretary or an employee of the Department (as the\ncase requires) under that provision of the amended legislative\ninstrument.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) does not apply to the making of an instrument."
    },
    {
